   ["[大家]都很好。", "[Dàjiā] dōu hěn hǎo.", "Everyone is fine.", "大家 = everyone. *All the people* isn't 都人: 都 looks back."],
   ["他们[都不]在。", "Tāmen [dōu bú] zài.", "None of them is here.", "都不 = all not = none."]
  ]},
  {"h": "Both: 也都"},
  {"text": "Together, 也 comes first."},
  {"ex": [
   ["我们[也都]很好。", "Wǒmen [yě dōu] hěn hǎo.", "We're all fine too."]
  ]}
